    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_02",
      "hash64": "C9E4B354552693BE",
      "text": "Aaah, l’air frais de Septentria !\\c\\nCe que j’aimerais acheter tous ces ions négatifs !\\nNon, mieux ! Je devrais en faire un business-han ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_01",
      "hash64": "F2AB8B2F8DFAEDE5",
      "text": "Je te reconnais bien là, Naire !\\c\\nMême ici, en province, tu continues de penser\\ncomme la serial entrepreneuse que tu es ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_03",
      "hash64": "C9E4B45455269571",
      "text": "Ah, mon cher Milio ! Heureusement, tu es là pour\\nrappeler au monde l’indiscutable vérité-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_02",
      "hash64": "F2AB882F8DFAE8CC",
      "text": "Mais je t’en prie !\\c\\nBon, comment souhaites-tu prodiguer ton\\nimmense fortune et ton précieux temps ?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_04",
      "hash64": "C9E4B55455269724",
      "text": "Bonne question, Milio... Bonne question.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_05",
      "hash64": "C9E4B654552698D7",
      "text": "Oh mais, que vois-je ? On dirait bien que\\ncet[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0200)]te impécunieu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]xse jeune [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]hofemme nous regarde.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_03",
      "hash64": "F2AB892F8DFAEA7F",
      "text": "Plaît-il ?![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_04",
      "hash64": "F2AB862F8DFAE566",
      "text": "Oh, mais oui, tu as raison !\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0402)]IlElle a l’air vraiment démuni[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0402"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_06",
      "hash64": "C9E4B75455269A8A",
      "text": "C’est donc à cela que ressemblent les gens\\nqui n’ont rien ! C’est inouï-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_07",
      "hash64": "C9E4B85455269C3D",
      "text": "Que faire, Milio ?! Penses-tu qu’il serait impoli\\nde demander à lui serrer la main ?\\r\\nOh ! Oh ! J’aimerais avoir son autographe ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_05",
      "hash64": "F2AB872F8DFAE719",
      "text": "Allons, du calme, Naire !\\nTu vas l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]ea faire fuir ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_08",
      "hash64": "C9E4A954552682C0",
      "text": "Tu dis vrai. Je suis confuse-han... Je n’ai vraiment\\npas l’habitude, alors je suis un peu nerveuse...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_06",
      "hash64": "F2AB842F8DFAE200",
      "text": "Ne t’inquiète pas, c’est normal que la directrice\\nde Paldea Immobilier ait autre chose à faire\\r\\nde ses journées.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_09",
      "hash64": "C9E4AA5455268473",
      "text": "Oui, oui, tout à fait.\\c\\nBon, euh... Pardonne-moi...\\nOui, toi, le col bleu, là-bas...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_10",
      "hash64": "C9E837545529A9E1",
      "text": "Je me demandais... Accepterais-tu de faire\\nun combat Pokémon contre moi-han ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_11",
      "hash64": "C9E836545529A82E",
      "text": "Si jamais tu arrives à me battre, tu recevras\\nde ma part une vraie petite fortune.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_07",
      "hash64": "F2AB852F8DFAE3B3",
      "text": "Ouah ! Naire, non seulement tu es belle,\\nmais tu as également un grand cœur ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_11",
      "hash64": "F2AF0F2F8DFE0408",
      "text": "C’est peut-être ça, ta vocation : donner\\nleur chance aux gens dans le besoin ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_12",
      "hash64": "C9E835545529A67B",
      "text": "Ho ho ho... N’hésite donc pas à me le faire savoir,\\nsi tu décides d’accepter ma proposition.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_npc",
      "hash64": "F67D01CCEA4BEA0D",
      "text": "Si ça t’intéresse de gagner un petit pactole,\\ntu peux parler à Naire. Ça sera la première fois\\r\\nqu’un col bleu lui adresse la parole, en plus ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_13",
      "hash64": "C9E834545529A4C8",
      "text": "Alors, veux-tu tenter de remporter une partie\\nde mes investissements en m’affrontant ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_14",
      "hash64": "C9E83B545529B0AD",
      "text": "Je n’aurais pas imaginé que quelqu’un comme toi\\npuisse me dire non... Comme c’est rafraîchissant !\\c\\nMais le temps, c’est de l’argent, donc je vais\\nm’occuper de toi maintenant ! Tu m’excuseras.\\c\\nOu pas-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 194,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 210,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_15",
      "hash64": "C9E83A545529AEFA",
      "text": "L’éminente directrice de Paldea Immobilier va\\nratatiner ce col bleu-han ! Regardez tous ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_08",
      "hash64": "F2AB922F8DFAF9CA",
      "text": "Allez ! Allez ! Tu es la meilleure, Naire ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_16",
      "hash64": "C9E839545529AD47",
      "text": "Ça alors ! Quelle puissance !\\nImpressionnant pour un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e prolétaire ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_09",
      "hash64": "F2AB932F8DFAFB7D",
      "text": "Allez ! Allez ! Qu’importe si tu as perdu, Naire !\\nTu restes la meilleure et la plus belle ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_17",
      "hash64": "C9E838545529AB94",
      "text": "J’ai un conseil pour toi : le plus important, avec\\nl’argent, c’est de savoir comment bien l’utiliser.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_18",
      "hash64": "C9E82F5455299C49",
      "text": "Je ne saurais trop te recommander de faire\\nfructifier cette petite fortune en l’investissant,\\r\\npour assurer ton avenir-han.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_19",
      "hash64": "C9E82E5455299A96",
      "text": "Ainsi, cette somme dépensée se transformera\\nen un patrimoine qui continuera d’être rentable ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
